{{define "external-devices-section"}}
<section id="section-external-devices">
	<h2>External devices</h2>
	<p class="hint">To use the DiGiCo iPad app(s) or other OSC devices with OSCWebMixer, add your connections here.</p>
	<div class="cards">
		{{range .ExternalDevices}}
		<div class="device-card" hx-post="/admin/external-devices/{{.ID}}" hx-trigger="change" hx-include="closest .device-card" hx-target="#section-external-devices" hx-swap="outerHTML">
			<input type="checkbox" class="toggle" name="broadcast" title="Broadcast" {{if .Broadcast}}checked{{end}} />
			<div class="device-fields">
				<input type="text" name="name" value="{{.Name}}" placeholder="Name" />
				<div class="device-address">
					<input type="text" name="ip" value="{{.IP}}" placeholder="IP" />
					<input type="number" name="port" value="{{.Port}}" placeholder="Port" />
				</div>
			</div>
			<label class="loopback"><input type="checkbox" name="loopback" {{if .Loopback}}checked{{end}} /> Loopback</label>
			<button type="button" hx-post="/admin/external-devices/{{.ID}}/delete" hx-target="#section-external-devices" hx-swap="outerHTML">Remove</button>
		</div>
		{{end}}
	</div>
	<button type="button" data-reveal=".add-device">+ Add device</button>
	<form hx-post="/admin/external-devices" hx-target="#section-external-devices" hx-swap="outerHTML" class="device-card add-device" hidden>
		<input type="checkbox" class="toggle" name="broadcast" title="Broadcast" checked />
		<div class="device-fields">
			<input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Name" required />
			<div class="device-address">
				<input type="text" name="ip" placeholder="IP" required />
				<input type="number" name="port" placeholder="Port" required />
			</div>
		</div>
		<label class="loopback"><input type="checkbox" name="loopback" /> Loopback</label>
		<button type="submit">Add device</button>
	</form>
	<details class="help">
		<summary>Help (iPad app / OSC devices)</summary>
		<p>OSCWebMixer acts as a router for OSC messages between the console and all connected devices.<br/>Devices connect to OSCWebMixer instead of the console, so multiple iPads can be connected to the same console at once.</p>
		<h4>DiGiCo SD/Quantum V2 iPad App</h4>
		<ol>
			<li><b>Desk IP:</b> The IP of the machine running OSCWebMixer.</li>
			<li><b>Send Port:</b> OSCWebMixer's OSC Listen Port ({{.OSC.Port}}).</li>
			<li><b>Receive Port:</b> Any free port. The simplest choice is the Console Receive Port ({{.Desk.Port}}). Devices can share the same port.</li>
		</ol>
		<p>The connection settings in the app should look like this:</p>
		<div class="help-example">
			<table>
				<tr><th>Connection Name</th><td><i>&lt;any&gt;</i></td></tr>
				<tr><th>Enter Desk IP</th><td><i>&lt;OSCWebMixer IP&gt;</i></td></tr>
				<tr><th>Enter Send Port</th><td>{{.OSC.Port}}</td></tr>
				<tr><th>Enter Receive Port</th><td>{{.Desk.Port}}</td></tr>
			</table>
		</div>
		<h4>On this page</h4>
		<ol start="4">
			<li>Click <b>+ Add device</b> and enter a name, the device's IP (shown as <b>Local IP</b> in the app) and the Receive Port from step 3.</li>
		</ol>
		<p>The <b>switch</b> on each device enables or disables the connection to the device.<br/><b>Loopback</b> also sends a device's own OSC messages back to it; leave it off unless the device needs that.</p>
	</details>
</section>
{{end}}
